The polish test fixtures build simple.epub / split.epub straight into the
shared cache path, and the fast path in needs_recompile() stats that path
before taking the lock; a parallel worker can see the half-written zip
(newer than the store's epoch-1 simple.html), skip the lock, and read it
through the forgiving unzipper -> "OPF file does not exist at location
pointed to by META-INF/container.xml". Build to a sibling temp file and
os.replace() into place so the cached path is either absent or complete.
